{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de3dec358e7edd3582029ec11addf3a3711122c3ad4b4af76819d38656197925", "ja": "（新しい仕事の依頼が来た。誰に声を掛けるか、\n悩み所だけど……。ん？　この声は、もしかして……）", "zh": "（接到了新工作的委托。该邀请谁来做呢，还真是让人伤脑筋……嗯？这个声音，难道是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "c75097b6847168f042a833a07303a4fa4abc944f15fe72b0757528b3dbb79c76", "ja": "おや？　{$P$}ちゃんが、\nこっちをチラチラ見てるぞ～！　これは……。", "zh": "咦？{$P$}正在偷偷瞄这边呢～！这可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "d68984ed930f4e4d00937c92f2324327b2faf6359800a0c5d0ad09e7560b3927", "ja": "何か茜ちゃんたちに、大きな仕事があると見た！\nほらほら、遠慮しないで！　カモン！", "zh": "我看啊，肯定有大工作要交给小茜他们了！  \n来嘛来嘛，别客气！过来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7f53e3571aa7d65ccc3824e81d4bdc28d55250f5f2dfa988cb2f75e78971ca09", "ja": "あ、ああ……本当に、\nこういうところはカンがいいな……。", "zh": "啊、啊啊……真是的，\n这种时候你的直觉还真准……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b9eda988dc80b986866984056baa8849e3330e02b9624b3b496f812e6114e1db", "ja": "茜も知っていると思うけど……ミリオンワールドランド\nから、仕事のオファーが来たんだ。", "zh": "茜应该也知道吧……米利昂世界乐园那边给我发来了工作邀请。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d41d44f871d15a218af86abc25e8b3b959af3c8925a950b316af929459a52646", "ja": "えっ。それって、テーマパークのですか？\nいいな～！", "zh": "咦？是主题乐园那边的工作吗？\n真好啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "6736d5694317415ebc9980d9615a95194657bda1b3b1055735182212e21019df", "ja": "あたし、田舎にいた頃、ちょっこし憧れてたべさ。\n東京に来たら、一度は行ってみたいなぁって。", "zh": "我还在乡下的时候，就有点向往来着。想着来了东京后，一定要去一次看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "f96eeb27cd5ba35f606dffbaad984074476cdf153c6a0ff1cb5a46beddd78d8e", "ja": "おお……{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんは今、感動しているよ……。", "zh": "哦……{$P$}！\n小茜现在感动得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "5045ebdcd307580142ed12fe7065995e09b49ba1d1e8fe4294e0d0d4fe160b1c", "ja": "こんな大きな仕事を取ってくるなんて、成長したね！\n敏腕！　太っ腹！　タイコ腹～！", "zh": "能接到这么大的工作，真是成长了呢！  \n能干！大方！肚子像太鼓～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e63aa30b6a56819f640e5fd11e78a116db05a00f05b1da912b18f592ad82a874", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……\nいや待て、タイコ腹は違わないか？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……\n不对，等一下，太鼓肚子不对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "36cbf7d4ef12c53d4245f1817fdf4895940997d2a8d39a5bd8f313d0da2d907d", "ja": "それでそれで？　{$P$}さん、\nどんなお仕事なんですか？　ライブとかするの？", "zh": "然后呢然后呢？{$P$}先生，是什么工作呀？要参加现场演出之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8e2b074f10d867c53c2c75e00572e06550bc3a69db9039198d23449eed927ebd", "ja": "基本は遊園地のアンバサダーで、CMやポスター。\nもちろん、ライブもやって欲しいそうだ。", "zh": "主要是游乐园的大使，要拍广告和海报。\n当然，对方也希望我们能办演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "b222ba7d3d5c933b95b2e1cb9507c57584d5c1e060f370ee9bca5b05397cc9a3", "ja": "なるほどね。お客さんの案内役でもあり、\nライブで盛り上げもする……重要なポジションだね！", "zh": "原来如此。既要担任客人的向导，\n又要在演出中炒热气氛……真是个重要的职位呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "437568a719ba03e5daff69e54d22fbe2e139c2fe0662cb5a8ea08a0b12cd11ad", "ja": "よーし、翼ちゃん、ひなたん！\n一緒に、思いっきり盛り上げちゃおう！", "zh": "好～嘞，翼、日向！\n我们一起，尽情把气氛搞热吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "0e3cef6f04042efb40460728f969fa52f83cb93cf906d25c9ef4ae1afe0f4048", "ja": "おーっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3038cefe385181d3c2cfcb5caf0d9b9122af035d4d7c37da075255a472817510", "ja": "いや、まだ誰をアサインするか\n決めていなかったんだけど……。", "zh": "不，其实我还没定下来\n要指派谁去呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "81c39f822bda6d09f34f5d67bc72c1cd333771ce533cb5cb65273843aa1d0930", "ja": "ギニャッ！？\nな、何言ってるの{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "呜哇！？  \n你、你在说什么呀，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "38d1e8e95598d25ee471161fbdf5042ac12cff3e8834c593383bc44f59f4762a", "ja": "テーマパークと言えば、茜ちゃんでしょ！？\nむしろ他に誰がいるというのか……？　いやいない！", "zh": "说到主题乐园，不就是小茜吗！？  \n倒不如说，还能有谁呢……？不，根本没有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1020_p", "source_sha256": "24d8672f19336c1d1533b68d52c927448867bfdef14d71cfe6b37058d3e1553c", "ja": "確かにそうなんだけど……。\n逆に、ピッタリすぎる気がするというか。", "zh": "确实是这样没错……\n但反过来说，感觉又太合适了，有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e5d493ab0a092f631684262ad4ad704a93be3a2d67d1f1ac189eb01cb573051a", "ja": "外部との仕事で、\n勝手にグッズの発注とかされると困るしな。", "zh": "要是和外部合作的工作，\n被擅自下单定制周边什么的就麻烦了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "fd6f7160042fbc34df758d2e8f12d7ee61976515c1e47327c31293c3767e86cd", "ja": "い、いやいやいや！　そんなことないって！\n茜ちゃん、空気は読める方ですから！", "zh": "不、不不不！才没有那回事呢！\n小茜我可是很会察言观色的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "6d3d3162f16a1cb47b0cca7bb483ba9a9d5e455d598bab0f1582ff4d539394ba", "ja": "遊園地を乗っ取っちゃおうとか、茜ちゃんグッズを\n内緒で売りさばこうとか……全然、考えてないから！", "zh": "比如想把游乐园占为己有啦，偷偷把小茜的周边卖掉啦……我完全没在想这些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1024_p", "source_sha256": "87ccfae3695a4d0f7bbca4970cfb8dd88afb71f395a3d878c77397b4aeb94a01", "ja": "……。本当に？", "zh": "……。真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "1cc2a74aea1987519a1e61e44c79fa065528f194f41e3afa1d938343f601bb9a", "ja": "ホントだよ、信じてよ{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃん的に、このチャンスは見逃せないんだよ～！", "zh": "真的啦，相信我嘛，{$P$}！\n从小茜的角度来说，这个机会可不能错过啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "7e57c1678b7b79f75a66521900031b478904533325fd11c4386a951f9026c8ce", "ja": "{$P$}、あのね、あたし……。\nあたしでよかったら、茜さんとこのお仕事したいなぁ。", "zh": "{$P$}，那个，我……  \n如果你不嫌弃我的话，我想和茜小姐一起做这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "c252dc9bf7b35dc5ed0fbd5aa74bf6271bef05da2f2c57c058b2b752af6724ea", "ja": "このお仕事、茜さんにピッタリだと思うんだわぁ。", "zh": "我觉得这份工作特别适合茜小姐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e53ce9f406a998c886c99bb08d4e71c1200697758c8fe5b81d7863165cea37b3", "ja": "わたしも、茜ちゃんとだったら楽しそう！\nねえ、{$P$}さん……ダメ？", "zh": "我也觉得，要是和小茜一起的话，一定会很开心！  \n呐，{$P$}先生……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1029_p", "source_sha256": "510fbad89b46b918239918bf594058aaaf6863b306b81cf079aa3cf791babc26", "ja": "う、うーん……茜、定期公演のレッスンも\nあるけど、両立できるのか？　サボったりしないか？", "zh": "唔，嗯……茜，你还有定期公演的课程，\n能兼顾得过来吗？不会偷懒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d57862a9d7d74f95ac6bb481bcb4d94ca74320c2e598c24b20754921159d2e7", "ja": "しないってば！　茜ちゃんならそれくらいできるって、\n{$P$}ちゃんも知ってるでしょ？", "zh": "都说了不会啦！如果是小茜，这点事还是做得到的，{$P$}也知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5385aa5b45d7ad63a5cb78a6b8163ab8fa0f98f4d27dc676cb5250615c62e93c", "ja": "よし、わかった。そこまで\n熱意があるなら、みんなに任せてみようか。", "zh": "好，知道了。既然你们这么有热情，就交给大家试试吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "8bfb8734b31fde3532430548875070ad75bc73329d32bc472e77a73b48092b7e", "ja": "やったーっ！", "zh": "太好啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "5a618074639595e242c96d0b93b8e2bbb734dd3eea8ea2298d20c7334a92ce7d", "ja": "やったべさ～♪", "zh": "太棒啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bc6ddff3ba060d44f9b55d3d4f752dc36801b7a27351d492b9a5c259a832db58", "ja": "やったー♪", "zh": "太好了──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f1133f0202ed61348fdfc212e2acc65326353b8f8a2903e944768fcaf519eb2f", "ja": "普段、劇場に来てくれている人達とは、\nちょっと違う客層にアピールできるチャンスだ。", "zh": "这是个能向平时来剧场的观众以外、\n不同客群展示的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1036_p", "source_sha256": "c23c762d0d6e5993029eea13cda5ef28d72e7ec38153ddef2d44f34d41aae831", "ja": "向こうのお客さんを奪うくらいの気持ちで、\n挑んでみてくれ！", "zh": "拿出要把那边的客人都抢过来的气势，\n放手去挑战吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_120_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_120_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "cbb4b557f50a0e43a3b0302a8d8f00cb2594ba08af310ceab49a80a5bb0f5cf0", "ja": "大丈夫大丈夫、わかってるから！\n茜ちゃんにおまかせだよ♪　……くっくっく。", "zh": "没问题没问题，茜懂的啦！\n就交给小茜吧♪……哼哼哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
